{"title": "Rajya Sabha Adjourned Twice Amid Protests Over NEET Exam Irregularities", "summary": "The Rajya Sabha was adjourned twice on Tuesday due to protests concerning alleged irregularities in the NEET (National Eligibility cum Entrance Test) examination. Opposition members demanded a government statement and a thorough investigation into the issue. The government did not make a climbdown on its stance regarding the matter. The house was initially adjourned until 2 pm and later until Wednesday.", "summary_points": ["The Rajya Sabha experienced two adjournments on Tuesday.", "Protests by opposition members over NEET exam irregularities caused the adjournments.", "Opposition members demanded a government statement and investigation.", "The government did not issue a statement or concede to demands.", "The Rajya Sabha was adjourned first until 2 pm, then until Wednesday."], "title_hi": "NEET परीक्षा अनियमितताओं पर विरोध के बीच राज्यसभा दो बार स्थगित", "summary_hi": "NEET (राष्ट्रीय पात्रता सह प्रवेश परीक्षा) परीक्षा में कथित अनियमितताओं को लेकर विरोध प्रदर्शनों के कारण मंगलवार को राज्यसभा को दो बार स्थगित कर दिया गया। विपक्षी सदस्यों ने सरकारी बयान और मामले की गहन जांच की मांग की। सरकार ने इस मामले पर अपना रुख नहीं बदला। सदन को पहले दोपहर 2 बजे तक और फिर बुधवार तक के लिए स्थगित कर दिया गया।", "summary_points_hi": ["मंगलवार को राज्यसभा को दो बार स्थगित किया गया।", "NEET परीक्षा में अनियमितताओं को लेकर विपक्षी सदस्यों के विरोध प्रदर्शनों के कारण स्थगन हुआ।", "विपक्षी सदस्यों ने सरकारी बयान और जांच की मांग की।", "सरकार ने कोई बयान जारी नहीं किया या मांगों को स्वीकार नहीं किया।", "राज्यसभा को पहले दोपहर 2 बजे तक, फिर बुधवार तक के लिए स्थगित किया गया।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning coverage highlighted the government's lack of \"climbdown\" on the NEET issue, emphasizing the repeated adjournments in the Rajya Sabha as a consequence of the government's stance.", "center": "Centrist coverage focused on the procedural aspect of the Rajya Sabha's adjournment, noting the disruptions caused by protests over the NEET issue and the specific times the house was suspended."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वाम-झुकाव वाले कवरेज ने NEET मुद्दे पर सरकार के \"पीछे हटने\" की कमी पर प्रकाश डाला, सरकार के रुख के परिणामस्वरूप राज्यसभा में बार-बार स्थगन पर जोर दिया।", "center": "मध्यमार्गी कवरेज ने NEET मुद्दे पर विरोध के कारण हुई बाधाओं और सदन के निलंबित होने के विशिष्ट समयों को नोट करते हुए, राज्यसभा के स्थगन की प्रक्रियात्मक पहलू पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया।"}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132696595,imgsize-804072.cms", "sources": [{"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/delulu-opposition-thinks-youth-are-with-it-rahul-suffering-from-fomo-nda/articleshow/132696081.cms", "headline": "Delulu opposition thinks youth are with it, Rahul suffering from FOMO: NDA"}, {"source": "Satya Hindi", "owner": "Satya Hindi", "lean": "left", "language": "hi", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "'वाह! क्या जुगलबंदी है!' Atishi Slams Rahul Gandhi Over PM Residence Protest #shorts"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Rajya Sabha adjourned till Wednesday amid uproar over NEET issue"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Rajya Sabha adjourned till Wednesday amid protests over NEET issue"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Rajya Sabha adjourned till 2 pm amid uproar"}, {"source": "India Today", "owner": "India Today Group", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE9IZHVJbGR4RGZCWnJyMDdFMjFGa0huZWtRVC1jeXRnMWNmSDBDTWdkR1hzWnk4eWpnQmJpZ0RkWFpaTkFtdGlIUEhGRkpPQ3FCW